  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. Cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks (peel if preferred) and place on the lined oven tray. <br>• Sprinkle with All-American spice blend, a pinch of salt and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d79e2c370e48f5637/step-5e56ff00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Drain sweetcorn. Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. <br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. <br>• In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. <br>• Cook garlic and corn until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and the salt and bring to the boil. <br>• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.</p> <div> <div id=\"message-list_1748880000000.D02482FJD8R\"></div> </div>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d79e2c370e48f5637/step-cfefd610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the pumpkin has 5 mins remaining, combine baby spinach leaves, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil in a large bowl. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d79e2c370e48f5637/step-d39a6c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide corn rice and spinach between bowls. <br>• Top with smokey roast pumpkin, haloumi, crumble over fetta cubes and drizzle with dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d79e2c370e48f5637/step-1b793e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
